    "FAQ": "常见问题",
    "HSK 5: at least 180 for the relevant Chinese-taught programmes. The HSK 4 / 210 entry in the table concerns a specific undergraduate programme, not a general graduate exemption.": "相关中文授课项目要求 HSK 5 级至少 180 分。表格中的 HSK 4 级 / 210 分仅适用于特定本科项目，并非研究生项目的通用豁免条件。",
    "Tuition: Master RMB 30,000/year; PhD RMB 40,000/year. 2026 figures, not a quote for a future intake. The graduate guides take precedence here over the different general-presentation housing range.": "学费：硕士每年 RMB 30,000；博士每年 RMB 40,000。以上为 2026 年数据，不代表未来批次的费用。此处以研究生招生指南为准，而非综合介绍中不同的住宿费用范围。",
    "Sources: supplied 2026 Master/Doctoral guides (3 pages each), 260401-XDU Introduction (44 pages), [0128英文版] XIDIAN UNIVERSITY (43 pages). Presentation images are credited where shown. Official contact:": "来源：所提供的 2026 年硕士和博士招生指南（各 3 页）、260401-XDU Introduction（44 页）及 [0128英文版] XIDIAN UNIVERSITY（43 页）。展示图片均在相应位置注明来源。官方联系方式：",
    "The “Graduation Outcomes” visual reproduces destinations shown in the presentation; it does not guarantee recruitment. The 95% undergraduate and 98% postgraduate figures in 260401, p. 15, are university-wide: no international-student-specific statistic is provided.": "“毕业去向”图片展示了介绍材料中列出的去向，不保证就业或录用。260401 材料第 15 页的本科生 95% 和研究生 98% 数据为全校统计，并未提供国际学生的单独统计。",
    "The [0128] presentation, p. 42, lists the Chinese Government Scholarship (tuition, accommodation, living allowance; 2026 deadline March 1), Central Asia Five-Nation Scholarship (tuition, accommodation, living allowance), Belt and Road (living allowance) and Huashan (tuition), with July 1 listed for the latter three. Eligibility, actual coverage and procedure vary; awards are never automatic.": "[0128] 介绍材料第 42 页列出了中国政府奖学金（学费、住宿费和生活补助；2026 年截止日期为 3 月 1 日）、中亚五国奖学金（学费、住宿费和生活补助）、一带一路奖学金（生活补助）和华山奖学金（学费）；后三项标注的截止日期为 7 月 1 日。申请资格、实际资助范围和流程各不相同，奖学金不会自动获得。",
    "1. Approve suggestions · 2. Open voting · 3. Close voting · 4. Confirm the film. Suggestions are frozen while voting is open.": "1. 审核建议 · 2. 开放投票 · 3. 关闭投票 · 4. 确认影片。投票期间不能更改影片建议。",
    "13 international clubs for sports, creativity and study. Find your next connection.": "13 个国际学生社团，涵盖体育、创作和学习。在这里结识志同道合的朋友。",
    "Applicant’s or parents’ bank statement: balance of at least RMB 30,000, stamped by the bank.": "申请人或父母的银行存款证明：余额至少为 RMB 30,000，并须加盖银行印章。",
    "The 2026 guides restrict Chinese Government Scholarship applicants to round one. July’s offer date is normalized to 2026: the PDF has a “20262” typo.": "2026 年指南规定，中国政府奖学金申请者须在第一轮申请。7 月的录取日期在此规范为 2026 年，原 PDF 中误写为“20262”。",
